    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch A Fish is a 3D platformer.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, run and collect fishes to finish a level and unlock the next one.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to buy hats in the shop.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect three stars in each level to unlock the corresponding achievement.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities like doublejump or dash and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go back to any level to collect missing stars or just farm coins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you help Kitty to become the greatest fisherman of all time ?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch A Fish is a 3D platformer.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, run and collect fishes to finish a level and unlock the next one.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to buy hats in the shop.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect three stars in each level to unlock the corresponding achievement.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities like doublejump or dash and more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go back to any level to collect missing stars or just farm coins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you help Kitty to become the greatest fisherman of all time ?</p>",
    "short_description": "Catch A Fish is a 3D platformer. Jump, run and collect fishes to finish a level and unlock the next one.",
